{"overview":"در سن ۲۶ سالگی، هنگامی که سلطنتش آغاز شد، سلطان سلیمان به دنبال ساختن امپراتوری‌ای قدرتمندتر از اسکندر کبیر و بی‌نقص کردن امپراتوری عثمانی بود. این سریال تلویزیونی، تثبیت قدرت سلیمان را نشان می‌دهد: پارغالی ابراهیم به عنوان وزیر اعظم، تقویت حاکمیت قانون در سراسر امپراتوری، ملاقات با دیپلمات‌های خارجی و آماده‌سازی برای کمپین‌های نظامی، همه در پس‌زمینه تنش بین اروپا مسیحی و امپراتوری عثمانی.","tagline":"","overview_en":"At the age of 26, when his reign began, Sultan Süleyman sought to build an empire more powerful than Alexander the Great and to render the Ottomans invincible. The television series shows Süleyman's consolidation of his power: Pargalı İbrahim being grand minister of state, reinforcing the rule of law throughout the empire, meeting foreign diplomats, and preparing for military campaigns, all set against the backdrop of the tension between Christian Europe and the Ottoman Empire.","tagline_en":"","runtime":90,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2011,"poster":"/wie5XK4Q9n2dvUwPVTj6XSaZHJe.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":39,"y":2011,"poster":"/iHvrOId8LFQaLleZgEmyvPk3NkD.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":40,"y":2012,"poster":"/2HwVfCvyQioVrFBWkrlnlO7Sl62.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":36,"y":2013,"poster":"/dfVwvvsLUBz37lCyaxHv2e59qjN.jpg"}],"episodes":139,"crew":["Timur Savcı"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"خالد ارگنچ","role":"I. Süleyman","photo":"/7L5ivMz1S7ArHTvUaslVVV3ML42.jpg","en":"Halit Ergenç"},{"name":"Nur Fettahoğlu","role":"Mahidevran Sultan","photo":"/yMxCbHQebr1ZVjOphUw3V1U5anC.jpg"},{"name":"مریم اوزرلی","role":"Hürrem Sultan","photo":"/oiG0HNjhMkQnOltQYsl7xt7RYSe.jpg","en":"Meryem Uzerli"},{"name":"Engin Öztürk","role":"Şehzade Selim","photo":"/nY0PvgJMtLXDlgrix4xwayqHu5C.jpg"},{"name":"Merve Boluğur","role":"Nurbanu Sultan","photo":"/1JomPe1BBJ2FobpZ5756JkUKI1Q.jpg"},{"name":"Nebahat Çehre","role":"Valide Ayşe Hafsa Sultan","photo":"/sWqAQdUAM5RJS0xdksHJQbnB5tb.jpg"},{"name":"Okan